key使用時、まだ消費されていない文字が消える\u003e","id":1,"title":"\u003chttps://github.com/skk-dev/ddskk/issues/197|#197 sticky-key使用時、まだ消費されていない文字が消える\u003e","text":"「発する(はっする)」を入力したいと思います。  \nskkにおいてこれを入力するには「HasSuru」と入力する必要があります。  \n以下のように遷移します。\n\n```\ninput: HasSu\n\n▽h\t\t\t\t\t; H\n▽は\t\t\t\t\t; a\n▽はs\t\t\t\t\t; s\n▽はっ*s\t\t\t\t\t; S\n▼発す\t\t\t\t\t; u\n\n```\n\nしかし、sticky-keyを使用して入力する場合、消費されていない「s」がなぜか消えてしまうため入力することができません。\n\n```\ninput: ;has;su\n\n▽\t\t\t\t\t; ;\n▽h\t\t\t\t\t; h\n▽は\t\t\t\t\t; a\n▽はs\t\t\t\t\t; s\n▽は*\t\t\t\t\t; ;\n▽は*s\t\t\t\t\t; s\n▼馳す\t\t\t\t\t; u\n\n```\n\n*init.el*\n\n```\n(setq skk-sticky-key \";\")\n(require 'skk)\n```","mrkdwn_in":["text"],"blocks":null,"footer":"\u003chttps://github.com/skk-dev/ddskk|skk-dev/ddskk\u003e","footer_icon":"https://slack.github.com/static/img/favicon-neutral.png","ts":1630304671}],"team":"T03C4RC8V","reactions":[{"name":"goodjob","count":5,"users":["U9S4G0LJW","U8CC7MDCL","U03C71D7H","U011FTGJ3SN","U7JL1UKKL"]}],"replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"y5Kg"}]},{"client_msg_id":"6ae990d6-837c-429d-a64c-686982ee2b4c","type":"message","user":"U03C71D7H","text":"~むしろddskkを直すべき~","ts":"1630303501.332800","team":"T03C4RC8V","reactions":[{"name":"grin","count":2,"users":["U9S4G0LJW","U7JL1UKKL"]}],"replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"OExH"}]},{"client_msg_id":"28b06422-8988-435c-a992-a80a58510d2b","type":"message","user":"U9S4G0LJW","text":"ddskkはこのパターンを拒否するので直そうか迷ってたけど処理が綺麗になったので直してよかった","ts":"1630303412.332200","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"0tKeW"}]},{"client_msg_id":"48a438e2-d072-4679-b9ca-d00f8d30ec6c","type":"message","user":"U9S4G0LJW","text":"\u003chttps://vim-jp.slack.com/archives/C01N4L5362D/p1630221429114400\u003e skkeletonのこれ直しました","ts":"1630303395.331600","attachments":[{"fallback":"[August 29th, 2021 12:17 AM] thinca: `;has;suru` だとう