accept minor patches and fix minor problems but there won't be major changes.\nddc.vim is the new generation of my auto complete plugin; Please consider moving into ddc!```\nとか","ts":"1630256581.298400","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"O05"}]},{"client_msg_id":"baa9adc8-f834-4400-a45c-dbd6925048fd","type":"message","user":"U022PB40WAF","text":"```This plugin is maintenance only. No future release.\nThe next generation ddc.vim. Let's move!```\n自分ならこう書くかなぁという感じで一応投げておきます。","ts":"1630255880.295500","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"GmG8"}]},{"client_msg_id":"a7b845c9-a5ed-4195-815a-2017e463c361","type":"message","user":"U022PB40WAF","text":"あー、完全にEOLさせた訳じゃないんですね。書いてあった英文がどうもEOLを意味するような文章になってたもんで。","ts":"1630254080.294100","edited":{"user":"U022PB40WAF","ts":"1630255985.000000"},"team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"mLtT"}]},{"client_msg_id":"ff67516a-bd0f-4ccf-a411-e33c729b6239","type":"message","user":"U7JL1UKKL","text":"メンテナンスは続いてるためです","ts":"1630253738.293200","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"0GARB"}]},{"client_msg_id":"8992a3a9-e9d1-40ae-b8cb-3b290cea43c2","type":"message","user":"U022PB40WAF","text":"そういえば、開発終了したdeoplete.nvimがアーカイブ設定になってないのは何か理由が？","ts":"1630250323.292600","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"dDja7"}]},{"client_msg_id":"26c736a9-a478-4e27-adcd-95b336dab547","type":"message","user":"U7JL1UKKL","text":"このsourceは考えるべきことが多すぎる。私の手には負えない","ts":"1630249618.292000","thread_ts":"1630249618.292000","reply_count":4,"team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"XxSdP"}]},{"client_msg_id":"d0937516-2e68-4ae2-a4c2-68afdc1937dc","type":"message","user":"U7JL1UKKL","text":"ddc.vimにfile path sourceが欲しいという要望が来ていたので、なぜ私が実装していないのかについてまとめておきました","ts":"1630249604.291500","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"PUrHY"}]},{"client_msg_id":"2a70652c-bd39-42d6-9910-5b8986880366","type":"message","user":"UGN0T63GC","text":"アクティブに更新されているようですし、issue 出せば対応してもらえるかもしれません。","ts":"1630312407.338400","thread_ts":"1630312132.335600","parent_user_id":"U8996GYBF","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"XDl"}]},{"client_msg_id":"17776a14-b3f8-4f76-b72b-899d0d8d26eb","type":"message","user":"U7JL1UKKL","text":"Windows対応以外にも考えることが多すぎるのですよ…","ts":"1630287618.326300","thread_ts":"1630285456.314000","parent_user_id":"U022PB40WAF","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"E+vmu"}]},{"client_msg_id":"d9c016bd-fee9-402e-aeef-61d198043bdb","type":"message","user":"U7JL1UKKL","text":"README更新しました","ts":"1630281099.308000","thread_ts":"1630259259.305100","parent_user_id":"U022PB40WAF","team":"T03C4RC8V","reactions":[{"name":"+1","count":1,"users":["U022PB40WAF"]}],"replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"pudH"}]},{"client_msg_id":"4fac3eaf-ab1f-48a2-b261-42141f0b9444","type":"message","user":"U8R597E9H","text":"正直、自分も Windows で動かない。みたいな issue きたら相当辛かったりするんですよね。。。わかります。\n（今のソースの出来はそこそこ満足してますが、`/` な sep しか扱ってないです。。。）","ts":"1630252515.292700","thread_ts":"1630249618.292000","parent_user_id":"U7JL1UKKL","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"YBfY"}]},{"client_msg_id":"3d20b105-20ee-4315-a6b4-e1d276085299","type":"message","user":"U7JL1UKKL","text":"ですよね。今回nvim-cmpのコードみましたがそれでも複雑だし、deopleteでは頑張って複雑なことやったので大量にバグが出てたいへんなことになったんです","ts":"1630253857.293300","thread_ts":"1630249618.292000","parent_user_id":"U7JL1UKKL","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"MNP"}]},{"client_msg_id":"031f3508-af82-49ec-8e43-1e5bf4b6a509","type":"message","user":"U7JL1UKKL","text":"neovimはWindowsサポートが弱くWindowsで動かないという話はほとんどこない気がします。これは幸せなことなのかな？","ts":"1630253899.293500","thread_ts":"1630249618.292000","parent_user_id":"U7JL1UKKL","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"lco5"}]},{"client_msg_id":"f5513fe2-83be-4e89-9b19-50eb4e8aecfd","type":"message","user":"U8R597E9H","text":"そんな気がしますね。\nあとよくよく考えてみると、Unix 形式のパスにおけるエスケープがバクスラなんで、Windows 形式のパスと混在はできないわけで、別ソースを作るみたいになりそうですね。。。果てしない。。。","ts":"1630254186.294200","thread_ts":"1630249618.292000","edited":{"user":"U8R597E9H","ts":"1630254196.000000"},"parent_user_id":"U7JL1UKKL","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"ZZx"}]}]
